["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1374: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin vaccine-derived poliovirus antibody-dependent enhancement BAU（binding antibody unit） turn the wild into mild\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-twiv-美国正式失去麻疹消除地位-97-病例发生在未接种人群/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>美国正式失去麻疹消除地位，97%病例发生在未接种人群</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加拿大的麻疹疫情显示：即使整体疫苗接种率很高，只要存在局部低接种社区，一场婚礼就能引爆近2400例病例；而美国的问题是全社会性的未接种蔓延，病例曲线没有平台期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen Ousted as Nvidia CEO: &quot;Spy&quot; Scandal, Export Restrictions, Market Impact D&amp;O insurance Chip Security Act recursive self-improvement\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-allin-黄仁勋下台疑云-真正的罪状可能是信息披露违规而非间谍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/768ce7c5ed30493a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋下台疑云：真正的罪状可能是信息披露违规而非间谍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主播们认为间谍指控和出轨丑闻更像是烟雾弹，真正导致黄仁勋辞职的可能是未向董事会披露利益冲突关系，触发了SEC季度合规声明的法律风险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 14: When the Holidays Are Stressful: How to Take the Pressure Off Family Time\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-14-parentmojo-化解圣诞探亲焦虑-与其管理祖孙关系-不如暂时离场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>化解圣诞探亲焦虑：与其管理祖孙关系，不如暂时离场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">父亲对圣诞五天探亲的焦虑来自想「管理」母亲与孩子的互动，教练建议他放手让孩子和祖母单独相处，反而更能满足所有人的需求。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亲子关系</span><span class=\"tag\">节假日压力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EMERGENCY POD: Jensen Out, MATCH Act In? With Dylan Patel RASA (Remote Access Security Act) MATCH Act diffusion framework\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-chinatalk-黄仁勋因走私丑闻下台-芯片战进入-炼厂逻辑-新阶段/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/02bd9aec53e783d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">53:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋因走私丑闻下台，芯片战进入「炼厂逻辑」新阶段</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正的杀招不是封杀芯片本身，而是沿供应链往上游打：禁设备、逼他们租芯片、再逼他们买AI，每上一级价值链利润越厚，中国越难追上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Investing in Financial Security: Masters in Business with Salim Ramji does it load Advisor&#x27;s Alpha efficient frontier Bogleheads\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-mastersinbiz-美国仅五分之一人请得起付费顾问-vanguard为此收购了altruist/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">51:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>美国仅五分之一人请得起付费顾问，Vanguard为此收购了Altruist</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">顾问退休速度快过新顾问补充，让本就只有五分之一美国人拥有付费财务顾问的缺口未来十年只会更差，这是Vanguard CEO Salim Ramji给出的收购Altruist的核心逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">资产管理</span><span class=\"tag\">低成本投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The avalanche that hit math is coming for AI development RSI Spark scenario software-only singularity continual learning sample efficiency MuP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-dwarkesh-数学两年从算错加法到破解千禧年难题-ai研究被同样速度追上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a162c5dee118ad3f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">44:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>数学两年从算错加法到破解千禧年难题，AI研究被同样速度追上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者判断AI在可验证的数学问题上两年内的进步速度，意味着AI研究本身同样是可被RL训练攻克的领域，中位预测2028年、最快可能明年，就会出现比人类顶尖专家更强的AI研究员。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI研究自动化</span><span class=\"tag\">递归自我改进</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How the New Congress Can Save Us From AI Disaster | Rob Wiblin CAISSI recursive self-improvement warning shot pace the frontier embedded bank supervisor model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-eightythousand-国会管住ai靠的不是多数票-而是下一次更严重的警示事件/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f016215860da66ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">18:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>国会管住AI靠的不是多数票，而是下一次更严重的警示事件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">民主党在中期选举大胜，但推翻总统对AI法案的否决仍需参议院67票绝对多数——真正可能撬动这个门槛的，很可能是比Hugging Face黑客事件更严重的下一次警示事件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI监管</span><span class=\"tag\">国会立法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Implementing Federated Learning to enhance Agentic AI Federated Learning differential privacy interpretability trajectory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-practicalai-智能体留下的对话记录太私密-不能直接拿去训练模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b58ad58ff08e43cb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">43:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Practical AI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>智能体留下的对话记录太私密，不能直接拿去训练模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能体的运行轨迹里藏着用户的提示词、病历、文件内容，这些数据比传统的手机照片更难公开收集，联邦学习成了在不搬动数据的前提下改进智能体的自然选择。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">联邦学习</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Loser Mentality ECM neocloud perps honeypot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-moneystuff-英伟达市值蒸发4000亿美元-只因ceo一段绯闻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">40:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达市值蒸发4000亿美元，只因CEO一段绯闻</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋曾公开嘲讽对华芯片担忧是「loser mentality」，如今他自己被曝与涉华人士有染，这段绯闻直接导致英伟达市值一夜蒸发约4000亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Behind the Scenes Minis: Knuckle Buster knuckle buster\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-stuffmissed-办一张商店信用卡-可能悄悄给你多开一个催收账户/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">25:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>办一张商店信用卡，可能悄悄给你多开一个催收账户</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">有的大型百货商店卡会在你不知情的情况下自动绑定一张Visa或Mastercard，月结余额被悄悄转到那张卡上，等你发现时账单已经进了催收。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">花絮闲聊</span><span class=\"tag\">信用卡历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The climate crisis: What the data really say | Cooked? Ep 1 data centre moratoriums renewable energy certificates endangerment finding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-naturepod-可再生能源涨得比所有人预测都快-这才是对抗气候变化真正的底牌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b1b06512ddf19b78-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">36:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>可再生能源涨得比所有人预测都快，这才是对抗气候变化真正的底牌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">太阳能价格十年内跌到不到原来的六分之一，各国实际减排进度比预料的更快，但全球排放至今仍在逐年上升而非下降。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">气候变化</span><span class=\"tag\">可再生能源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"E258 这个东西，我真的好想要！｜小酒馆故事会🍻 高刷屏\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-zhixing-十年攒钱不舍得买车-直到妈妈确诊癌症才懂延迟满足有前提/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6630e1490acdc8b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">2:02:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒馆</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>十年攒钱不舍得买车，直到妈妈确诊癌症才懂延迟满足有前提</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他十年前就攒够了买特斯拉的钱，却一次次转投房产股票；直到母亲确诊胰腺癌、靶向药只能延命8到9个月，他才想到延迟满足得先活到满足那天。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费观</span><span class=\"tag\">延迟满足</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Every Day Is Zero Day | Wiz CTO Ami Luttwak Blue Agent / Red Agent Atlas CSPM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-a16z-黑色十月改变安全规则-ai-攻击全程只要-20-分钟/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>黑色十月改变安全规则：AI 攻击全程只要 20 分钟</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Wiz CTO 说这是黑天鹅事件：开源模型追上了闭源模型的漏洞挖掘能力，攻击者从拿到入口到偷走全部密钥，整个过程只需约 20 分钟。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI攻击</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"695. Can the U.S. Close Its Fertility Gap? fertility gap tempo effect instrumental variable strategy redlining\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-freakonomics-居家办公让美国多生了30万个孩子-比任何育儿补贴都有效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">56:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>居家办公让美国多生了30万个孩子，比任何育儿补贴都有效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">政府发钱催生基本无效，但远程办公这个免费副产品让美国生育率实打实上升——夫妻各自每周在家一天以上，生育意愿就能从1.7冲到2.2。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生育率</span><span class=\"tag\">住房政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"516 从马克·布洛赫入祀先贤祠看年鉴学派与当代法国社会文化思潮 Annales School Panthéon longue durée\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-cn2aa250-马克-布洛赫入祀先贤祠-历史学家如何被总统们轮流消费/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>马克·布洛赫入祀先贤祠：历史学家如何被总统们轮流消费</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">布洛赫生前反感学术权力、拒绝种族身份标签，死后却成了历届法国总统塑造「抵抗总统」人设的工具，他的家属也因此分裂成赞成与反对两派。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">年鉴学派</span><span class=\"tag\">法国史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vol.291｜杂吧地：天桥艺人和他们的江湖｜嘉宾：岳永逸×孟庆延 杂巴地 撂地 海清 三不管\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-cn27f438-金庸写的是山林幻想-天桥艺人的江湖才是真实的中国社会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">东腔西调</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>金庸写的是山林幻想，天桥艺人的江湖才是真实的中国社会</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">连阔如亲历的江湖，是国家行政力量管不到的地方、一个行业自发形成规矩、靠口碑而非头衔维系秩序的真实生活世界；金庸笔下那个门派林立的江湖，其实更接近陶渊明式的山林幻想。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民俗学</span><span class=\"tag\">江湖文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bedtime Battles: 5 Mistakes Making Sleep Harder From Toddlers to Teens\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-raisinggh-睡前谈判-开着电视-太兴奋-五个让孩子更难入睡的习惯/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f4ab6c930f328d5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">26:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>睡前谈判、开着电视、太兴奋：五个让孩子更难入睡的习惯</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子抗拒睡觉不是叛逆而是生理反应，真正拖垮睡眠的是父母自己制造的睡前刺激、顺序混乱、屏幕、讨价还价和环境问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童睡眠</span><span class=\"tag\">养育方式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"特番｜从做题家变成出题家，才能为硬技术找新用途\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-bizthisway-红外公司转型做质检设备时发现-自己只值10-的生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">42:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商业就是这样</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>红外公司转型做质检设备时发现：自己只值10%的生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">做红外全身医疗筛查时，高德质感提供的技术只占整个诊断服务价值的10%，剩下90%靠医疗认知和现场服务——于是他们放弃自己包办，转向只卖核心零部件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">红外技术</span><span class=\"tag\">硬科技商业化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why a $2 Billion Law Firm Suddenly Collapsed eat what you kill lockstep compensation fraudulent transfer liability MSO (managed service organization) generational conflict\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-oddlots-合伙制律所能在零负债-利润仍增长时突然倒闭/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">58:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>合伙制律所能在零负债、利润仍增长时突然倒闭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一家95年历史的华尔街律所没有巨额负债，利润也逐年上升，却因增速跑输同行，在几个月内像银行挤兑一样瓦解，证明合伙制企业的致命伤是相对而非绝对表现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">合伙制</span><span class=\"tag\">律所治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bravo, Comrade Lysenko! The Man who Failed to Feed the USSR vernalisation Lysenkoism Green Revolution\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-cautionary-苏联农学家靠一盆花拒绝做实验-饿死了同行也没喂饱苏联/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">43:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>苏联农学家靠一盆花拒绝做实验，饿死了同行也没喂饱苏联</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李森科说「饥饿不等人」拒绝田间试验，靠花盆里的一株麦子就宣布培育成功；博洛格同样面对饥荒，却用更多对照实验喂饱了墨西哥。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科学方法</span><span class=\"tag\">苏联历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nvidia After Jensen Huang, What Huang Meant to the AI Ecosystem, Washington Gets Its Revenge Neoclouds Mellanox / MVLink N-2 rule MSS honeypot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-sharptech-黄仁勋下台不是桃色事件-是华盛顿对英伟达积怨已久的总清算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a309a358a363994-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Sharp Tech</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋下台不是桃色事件，是华盛顿对英伟达积怨已久的总清算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达对华出口政策上屡次顶撞国安系统，才是黄仁勋被赶下台背后真正的导火索，绯闻只是压垮他的最后一根稻草。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英伟达</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片禁令</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"187: 对话LiberAI刘松铭：Astra来袭，00后物理AI创始人看到的胜率 VLA WAM System 0/1/2 Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-latetalk-物理ai创始人提前押注硬件-基模一来-模型就会变薄/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/90e5508108d67243-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:09:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>物理AI创始人提前押注硬件：基模一来，模型就会变薄</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">刘松铭创业时就判断GPT-6 Astra这类基模会吃掉具身智能的「System 2」部分，于是从第一天就把硬件和产品做成护城河，而不是先做一家纯模型公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">物理AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI红娘，3小时融资1500万｜王钦文对话曾歆勋 EV1匹配 T度\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-wangqinwen-良配巴不得用户尽快离开-这恰恰是它的赚钱逻辑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">王</div><span class=\"dur\">59:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">王钦文</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>良配巴不得用户尽快离开，这恰恰是它的赚钱逻辑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">良配卖的是不可续费会员，用户配对成功就该走人——用户走得越快，平台要烧的token越少，这跟靠留存赚钱的多数AI产品正好相反。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI应用</span><span class=\"tag\">婚恋社交</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"156. 《侠》｜对影之刃零制作人梁其伟6小时访谈\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-13-zhangxiaojun-踩中风口在成功里只占1-99-是你是不是那块料/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/66aff61ecaa4b4d5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">6:27:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>踩中风口在成功里只占1%，99%是你是不是那块料</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">梁其伟用自己多年做游戏的教训说：风口和资本叙事能撑起短期流水，但真正决定命运的，从来是创作者的心性而非外部环境。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">武侠文化</span><span class=\"tag\">游戏行业</span>\n</div></div></a>"]